  "notes": "(read 2026-10-15 on assortion.com/pricing and the Shopify App Store listing apps.shopify.com/assortion, prices in USD) Assortion has one feature set and charges by the size of your store: the price depends on your total monthly store orders, not only the orders that include an upsell. 0 to 50 orders a month costs $9.99, 51 to 200 costs $19.99, 201 to 500 costs $34.99, 501 to 1,000 costs $59.99, 1,001 to 2,500 costs $89.99, 2,501 to 5,000 costs $149.99 and more than 5,000 costs $199.99. The two top tiers overlap at exactly 5,000 orders on the page. The Shopify listing shows only the first three tiers and bills every 30 days. Development stores use the app for free with all features. Paid plans list a 14-day free trial, cart customization, upsells, product add-ons and live support. No annual price is shown.",
